  ($q$bollywood$q$, $q$choice$q$, 1, $q$IN$q$, $q$Which 1995 film has Shah Rukh Khan as Raj and Kajol as Simran?$q$, $q$["Kuch Kuch Hota Hai", "Dilwale Dulhania Le Jayenge", "Kabhi Khushi Kabhie Gham", "Devdas"]$q$::jsonb, $q${"option": 1}$q$::jsonb, null, $q$https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dilwale_Dulhania_Le_Jayenge$q$, $q$The film stars Shah Rukh Khan and Kajol as Raj and Simran, two young non-resident Indians, who fall in love during a vacation through Europe with their friends.$q$, null, null),
