-- Quiz Night's seed bank: hand-checked questions, so a quiz runs with no AI at all (CI, and the scripted quiz master).
--
-- Every answer is backed by its source: the quote is the sentence fetched from that page (Wikipedia, or the image's
-- Wikimedia Commons page), read and checked against the answer, not written from memory. Picture questions use
-- public-domain images from Wikimedia Commons, copied into the quiz-images bucket under names made from a hash of
-- the image (so a name never gives the answer away); `supabase start` loads them from supabase/seed/storage.

